-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zkuZ2svCpUsQ7kNvwE7mTtw&_nc_oc=Adrxk1K6qB65a9HeHqnOXW4Ao63OPkS3G0kc2YHD01bdLgrhBE0fORlqqh71u-h7no8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDZj3QFZ9Hp3xFewi5irPx3e_AB5tj2kOSq43DHwEE3Q&oe=6AFB2488"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics", "keywords": ["NCSG", "Chimney", "Sweep", "Training", "Gas"], "long_description": "\n\n**Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics** trains users on core skills required to safely understand, inspect, and diagnose common gas fireplace systems encountered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools.\n\n**Gas System Fundamentals** \u2013 Learn how common gas fireplace systems are designed, including millivolt and electronic ignition configurations.\n\n**Component Identification**\u2013 Identify key gas components such as valves, pilots, thermocouples, thermopiles, stepper motors, limit switches, and shutoff devices.\n\n**Electrical Testing Procedures** \u2013 Practice safe multimeter use for voltage, resistance, and continuity testing across gas system components.\n\n**Operational Understanding** \u2013 Observe how gas systems operate during startup, normal operation, and shutdown, and how failures affect performance.", "short_description": "**Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics** trains users on core skills required to safely understand, inspect, and diagnose common gas fireplace systems encountered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools."}]}, "develope